<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Debug overrides.

  Nic, round 9: *"in my device htere are two filet.. whihc ones whihc? is the other one debug?
  cause when i udpated for mtheat suspected debug vrsion it created another instance instead of
  updating it"*

  Nothing was duplicated. `dev.niccc2007.filet` and `dev.niccc2007.filet.debug` are two
  different applications by design - that is what round 8's B-series made possible - so an
  install of one never updates the other. The bug was that they were indistinguishable: same
  name, same icon, no way to tell which you were opening.

  Trawl already solved this and the answer is the obvious one: give the debug build its own
  name and its own colours.
-->
<resources>
    <string name="app_name">Filet Debug</string>
</resources>
